  "changed_since_previous": "Adds an explicit `isinstance(txhash, int)` type assertion inside `PeerTxRelayer.assert_never_requested` to prevent caller type mismatches.",
  "card": "Fixes a bug in the p2p_orphan_handling functional test where assertions passed hex strings instead of integers to assert_never_requested. Because an integer never equals a string in Python, these checks passed vacuously regardless of what the node actually requested. The PR passes integers, enforces the integer type in the helper, switches the initial relaying peer, and advances mocktime so requests can trigger and regressions are caught. This is test-only code fixing non-functional test assertions with low risk.",
